@startuml 设备租赁时序图
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title 体育场馆管理系统 - 设备租赁时序图

actor "会员" as Member
participant "前端Vue" as Front
participant "ZulinjiluController" as Controller
participant "ShebeizulinService" as SBService
participant "ZulinjiluService" as ZLService
participant "MySQL" as DB
actor "管理员" as Admin

Member -> Front: 1. 选择设备，填写数量
Front -> Controller: 2. POST /zulinjilu/add
activate Controller

Controller -> SBService: 3. 查询设备库存
activate SBService
SBService -> DB: 4. SELECT * FROM shebeizulin
activate DB
DB --> SBService: 5. 设备信息
deactivate DB
SBService --> Controller: 6. 设备实体
deactivate SBService

Controller -> Controller: 7. 计算租赁金额
Controller -> ZLService: 8. 创建租赁记录
activate ZLService
ZLService -> DB: 9. INSERT INTO zulinjilu
activate DB
DB --> ZLService: 10. 插入成功
deactivate DB
ZLService --> Controller: 11. 返回结果
deactivate ZLService

Controller --> Front: 12. 租赁申请已提交
deactivate Controller
Front --> Member: 13. 等待审核

Admin -> Controller: 14. POST /zulinjilu/shBatch
activate Controller
Controller -> DB: 15. UPDATE sfsh='已通过'
DB --> Controller: 16. 审核成功
Controller --> Front: 17. 审核通过通知
deactivate Controller

Member -> Front: 18. 归还设备
Front -> Controller: 19. POST /zulinguihai/add
activate Controller
Controller -> DB: 20. INSERT INTO zulinguihai
DB --> Controller: 21. 归还成功
Controller --> Front: 22. 归还完成
deactivate Controller

@enduml
